Package: mini-o
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0) | node (>= 18.0.0), curl
Recommends: systemd, ollama
Maintainer: Redrum AI Team <jerimiepalmer81@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/redrum-ai/mini-o
Description: Mini-O / Redrum AI - Local-first personal AI workspace and companion
 Mini-O is a private, local-first AI workspace and companion application.
 It provides local LLM integration, workspace file management, custom
 agent instructions (AGENT.md), resilient diagnostics, and tool execution.
 .
 Features include:
  * Local Ollama and remote model support
  * Workspace file editor with concurrency protection
  * Extensible tool execution with confirmation policies
  * Diagnostic event tracing for client and server
  * Native desktop launcher and systemd service integration
